    "name": "legal-compliance",
    "description": "Jurisdiction-aware legal, regulatory, and compliance skill for founders. Ships with a complete UAE reference set as the worked example. Non-UAE founders wire in their own jurisdiction's source documents (PDFs, government URLs, gazetted acts) at setup, and the skill answers from those instead. Trigger on: legal question, regulation, hire/fire, termination, contract, NDA, trademark, IP, privacy, data protection, tax filing, VAT, corporate tax, license renewal, visa, work permit, dispute, court, arbitration, compliance deadline, or any situation with legal implications. Always grounds answers in loaded reference docs - never invents law.\n",
